                                "sense_id": "e3654b21-fb59-3003-8a1a-98c8d0a49711",
                                "text": "„[…] Onder de Duitsche Joden in Londen is „crematie” eveneens verre van onbekend.”",
                                "translation": "\" […] Among the German (Ashkenazi) Jews in London \"cremation\" is also far from unfamiliar.\"",
